ously the confidentiality of your  identity  and health information is of the utmost  importance  your name will never be shared with  anyone who refers to  and their privacy will be protected as  well ultimately  privacy encourages participation in  adoption and as a result  will help us protect more people oh  that's great i see leveraging google  cloud's  contact center ai and dialog flow as  well as expertise in ai and ml  built into our speech text and natural  language processing solutions  we were able to automate many of the  human contact tracer tasks  additionally we are able to  automatically transform this  conversation from unstructured  to structured data for further analysis  by public health agencies  here's the high-level architecture at  each stage  collection transformation analysis and  visualization  we are using serverless technology to  deliver a modern  and scalable solution for government and  this solution provides  powerful out-of-the-box analyses and  visualizations  which enables public health responders  to take action immediately  throughout the pandemic we've been  implementing this and many other public  health  response solutions with government  customers around the world  for example the state of illinois has  deployed ccai and dialog flow in their  contact centers to aid  in their pandemic response efforts both  for contact tracing  and for benefit programs  additionally the state of new york is  done similar both of these states have  been hit hard by kova 19 and are  seeing success using these types of  solutions in responding to the pandemic  so circling back to our functional  overview and the core  google cloud smart analytics platform  let's take a quick look at the  visualization output from this platform  here's an example here  we're leveraging google's looker  dashboarding  visualization and business intelligence  tool  to bring in visualize and analyze  all of the covid19 data that we're  collecting  into the public he